#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management.rst:16
msgid "Resource Management"
msgstr "Upravljanje virov"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management.rst:18
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Resources are pluggable bits of data, like brush presets or patterns. Krita "
"has a sophisticated resource management system, which allows tagging, "
"disabling, sharing and more."
msgstr ""
"Viri so vtični biti podatkov, kot so prednastavitev čopiča ali vzorci. Krita "
"ima prefinjen sistem upravljanja virov, ki omogoča označevanje, "
"onemogočevanje, deljenje in še kaj."

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management.rst:22
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"All resources are stored in the resource folder. This folder can be "
"configured in :ref:`the general preferences <resource_settings>`. As keeping "
"track of all those resources can be a handful, Krita creates a SQLite cache "
"in which it keeps the tags, names, version and other data about the resource."
msgstr ""
"Vsi viri so shranjeni v mapi virov. To mapo je mogoče konfigurirati v :"
"ref:'splošne nastavitve <resource_settings>'. Ker je spremljanje vseh teh "
"virov lahko pest, Krita ustvari SQLite predpomnilnik, v katerem hrani "
"oznake, imena, različico in druge podatke o viru."

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management.rst:24
msgid ""
"Thanks to this cache, Krita can avoid loading a resource until necessary. "
"This makes Krita a lot lighter than when it did not have this cache. "
"Deleting the cache will delete the tags and relationships it keeps track of, "
"so be careful."
msgstr ""
"Zahvaljujoč temu predpomnilniku se Krita lahko izogne nalaganju vira, dokler "
"ni potrebno. Zaradi tega je Krita veliko hitrejša kot takrat, ko je bila "
"brez tega predpomnilnika. Brisanje predpomnilnika bo izbrisalo oznake in "
"odnose, ki jih spremlja, zato bodite previdni."

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management.rst:26
msgid ""
"If you have not changed your resource folder location, the resources can be "
"found at..."
msgstr "Če niste spremenili mesta mape z viri, lahko vire najdete v …"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management.rst:28
msgid "Linux"
msgstr "Linux"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management.rst:29
msgid ":file:`$HOME/.local/share/krita/`"
msgstr ":file:`$HOME/.local/share/krita/`"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management.rst:30
msgid "Windows"
msgstr "Okna"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management.rst:31
msgid ":file:`%APPDATA%\\\\krita\\\\`"
msgstr ":file:`%APPDATA%\\\\krita\\\\`"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management.rst:33
msgid "macOS"
msgstr "macOS"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management.rst:33
msgid ":file:`~/Library/Application Support/Krita/`"
msgstr ":file:`~/Library/Application Support/Krita/`"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management.rst:36
msgid ""
"If you installed Krita in the Windows Store, your custom resources will be "
"in a location like:"
msgstr ""
"Če ste krito namestili iz Trgovine Windows, bodo vaši viri po meri na mestu, "
"kot je:"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management.rst:36
msgid ""
":file:`%LOCALAPPDATA%\\\\Packages\\\\49800Krita_{RANDOM STRING}\\\\LocalCache"
"\\Roaming\\krita`"
msgstr ""
":file:`%LOCALAPPDATA%\\\\Packages\\\\49800Krita_{RANDOM STRING}\\\\LocalCache"
"\\Roaming\\krita`"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management.rst:41
msgid "Resource Libraries"
msgstr "Knjižnice virov"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management.rst:43
msgid "Krita can load a variety of resource libraries."
msgstr "Krita lahko naloži različne knjižnice virov."

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management.rst:46
msgid "Resource Folder"
msgstr "Mapa z viri"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management.rst:48
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The resource folder is considered the primary library. When creating new "
"resources, they will all end up here. You can configure its location in the :"
"ref:`general preferences <resource_settings>`."
msgstr ""
"Mapa z viri velja za primarno knjižnico. Pri ustvarjanju novih virov bodo "
"vsi končali tukaj. Njegovo lokacijo lahko konfigurirate v :ref:'splošnih "
"<resource_settings>preferencah '."

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management.rst:49
msgid "Resource Bundle"
msgstr "Sveženj virov"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management.rst:51
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The primary format to share resources is :dfn:`Resource Bundles`, which is a "
"compressed file containing all the resources together. It also contains some "
"other information like metadata and a manifest so Krita can check there's no "
"errors in the file."
msgstr ""
"Primarna oblika za skupno rabo virov je :d fn:'Paketi virov', ki je "
"stisnjena datoteka, ki vsebuje vse vire skupaj. Vsebuje tudi nekatere druge "
"informacije, kot so metapodatki in manifest, da krita lahko preveri, da v "
"datoteki ni napak."

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management.rst:52
msgid "Adobe Brush Library"
msgstr "Knjižnica čopičev Adobe"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management.rst:54
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"An ``ABR`` with multiple images inside. Previous versions of Krita could not "
"load this, but now Krita will load them as a library of :ref:`brushes "
"<resource_brush_tips>`."
msgstr ""
"\"ABR\" z več slikami v notranjosti. Prejšnje različice Krita tega ni mogel "
"naložiti, zdaj pa jih bo Krita naložila kot knjižnico :"
"ref:'<resource_brush_tips>čopiči '."

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management.rst:55
msgid "Adobe Style Library"
msgstr "Knjižnica slogov Adobe"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management.rst:57
msgid ""
"This is the :program:`Photoshop` ``ASL`` format, which stores :ref:"
"`layer_style`."
msgstr ""
"To je zapis »ASL« programa :p:`Photoshop`, ki hrani :ref:`layer_style`."

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management.rst:58
msgid "Document Storage"
msgstr "Shranjevanje dokumentov"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management.rst:60
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Every Krita document can store resources and act as a resource library. This "
"is currently only used for palettes."
msgstr ""
"Vsak Dokument Krita lahko shrani vire in deluje kot knjižnica virov. Ta se "
"trenutno uporablja samo za palete."

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management.rst:61
msgid "Memory Storage"
msgstr "Shranjevanje pomnilnika"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management.rst:63
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Finally, the memory library is where temporary resources are kept, which are "
"generated by Krita and have no physical version on disk. This is currently "
"used for the fore-to-background gradient."
msgstr ""
"Nazadnje je knjižnica pomnilnika tam, kjer se hranijo začasni viri, ki jih "
"ustvarja Krita in na disku nima fizične različice. Ta se trenutno uporablja "
"za preliv od e-do ozadja."

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management.rst:65
msgid ""
"You can manage resource libraries by going to :menuselection:`Settings --> "
"Manage Resource Libraries`. In this dialog, you can import resource "
"libraries, deactivate them, and also :ref:`create_bundle`."
msgstr ""
"Knjižnice virov lahko upravljate tako, da izberete :menuselection:"
"`Nastavitve --> Upravljaj knjižnice virov`. V tem pogovornem oknu lahko "
"uvozite knjižnice virov, jih deaktivirate in tudi ustvarite sveženj (:ref:"
"`create_bundle`)."

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management.rst:68
msgid "Importing Bundles"
msgstr "Uvažanje svežnjev"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management.rst:70
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To import a bundle click on :guilabel:`Import` button on the top right side "
"of the dialog. Select ``.bundle`` file format from the file type if it is "
"not already selected, browse to the folder where you have downloaded the "
"bundle, select it and click :guilabel:`Open`. Once the bundle is imported it "
"will be listed in the bundle view. To enable or disable a bundle, select the "
"entry in the view, and then select :guilabel:`Deactivate`."
msgstr ""
"Če želite uvoziti paket kliknite na :guilabel:'Import' gumb na zgornji desni "
"strani pogovornega okna. Izberite format datoteke ''.bundle'' iz vrste "
"datoteke, če še ni izbrana, poiščite mapo, v kateri ste prenesli svežnje, jo "
"izberite in kliknite :guilabel:'Open'. Ko bo paket uvožen, bo naveden v "
"pogledu svežnjev. Če želite omogočiti ali onemogočiti paket, izberite vnos v "
"pogledu in nato izberite :guilabel:'Deaktiviraj'."

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management.rst:76
msgid "Creating your own Bundle"
msgstr "Ustvarjanje lastnega svežnja virov"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management.rst:78
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You can create your own bundle from the resources of your choice. Click on "
"the :guilabel:`Create bundle` button. This will open a dialog box as shown "
"below."
msgstr ""
"Sami lahko ustvarite svežnje iz virov po vaši izbiri. Kliknite na gumb :"
"guilabel:'Create bundle'. To bo odprlo pogovorno okno, kot je prikazano "
"spodaj."

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management.rst:81
msgid ".. image:: images/resources/Creating-bundle.png"
msgstr ".. image:: images/resources/Creating-bundle.png"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management.rst:82
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The left hand section is for filling up information about the bundle like "
"author name, website, email, bundle icon, etc. The right hand side provides "
"a list of available resources. Choose the type of resource you wish to add "
"in to the bundle from the drop-down above and add it to the bundle by "
"selecting a resource and clicking on the arrow button."
msgstr ""
"Razdelek z levo roko je za polnjenje informacij o svežnju, kot so ime "
"avtorja, spletna stran, e-pošta, ikona svežnja itd. Na desni strani je "
"seznam razpoložljivih virov. Izberite vrsto vira, ki ga želite dodati v "
"svežnje iz spustnega seznama zgoraj, in ga dodajte v svežnje tako, da "
"izberete vir in kliknete puščico gumb."

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management.rst:87
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Make sure you add brush tips for used in the respective paintop presets you "
"are adding to the bundle. If you don't provide the brush tips then the brush "
"presets loaded from this bundle will have a 'X' mark on the thumbnail "
"denoting that the texture is missing. And the brush preset won't be the same."
msgstr ""
"Prepričajte se, da dodate nasvete za krtačo, ki se uporabljajo v ustreznih "
"prednastavitevh paintop, ki jih dodajate v svežnje. Če ne zagotovite "
"nasvetov za krtačo, bodo prednastavitve ščetke, naložene iz tega svežnja, "
"imele oznako \"X\" na sliki, ki označuje, da tekstura manjka. In "
"prednastavitev čopiča ne bo enaka."

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management.rst:89
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Once you have added all the resources you can create bundle by clicking on "
"the :guilabel:`Save` button, the bundle will be saved in the location you "
"have specified. You can then share this bundle with other artists or load it "
"on other workstations."
msgstr ""
"Ko dodate vse vire, ki jih lahko ustvarite, tako da kliknete gumb :"
"guilabel:'Save', bo svežnje shranjeno na mestu, ki ste ga določili. Ta paket "
"lahko delite z drugimi umetniki ali pa ga naložite na druge gradbene stene."

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management.rst:92
msgid "Deleting Imported Bundles"
msgstr "Brisanje uvoženih svežnjev"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management.rst:94
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"In case you wish to delete the bundles you have imported *permanently* click "
"on the :guilabel:`Open Resource Folder` button in the :guilabel:`Manage "
"Resources` dialog. This will open the resource folder in your file browser. "
"Go inside the bundles folder and delete the bundle file which you don't need "
"any more. The next time you start Krita the bundle and its associated "
"resources will not be loaded."
msgstr ""
"Če želite izbrisati pakete, ki ste jih uvozili *trajno* kliknite na gumb :"
"guilabel:'Open Resource Folder' v pogovornem oknu :guilabel:'Upravljanje "
"virov'. To bo odprlo mapo z viri v brskalniku datotek. Pojdite v mapo s "
"paketi in izbrišite datoteko svežnjev, ki je ne potrebujete več. Ko boste "
"naslednjič zagnali Krito, paket in njegovi povezani viri ne bodo naloženi."

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management.rst:99
msgid "Managing Resources"
msgstr "Upravljanje virov"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management.rst:101
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"As mentioned earlier Krita has a flexible resource management system. "
"Starting from version 2.9 you can share various resources mentioned above by "
"sharing a single compressed ZIP file created within Krita."
msgstr ""
"Kot smo že omenili, ima Krita prilagodljiv sistem upravljanja virov. Začenš "
"z različico 2.9 lahko delite različne vire, navedene zgoraj, tako da delite "
"eno samo stisnjeno datoteko ZIP, ustvarjeno znotraj Krite."

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management.rst:103
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The manage resources section in the settings was also revamped for making it "
"easy for the artists to prepare these bundle files. You can open manage "
"resource section by going to :menuselection:`Settings --> Manage Resources..."
"` menu item."
msgstr ""
"Razdelek upravljanje virov v nastavitvah je bil prav tako spremenjen, da bi "
"umetnikom olajšali pripravo teh datotek svežnja. Razdelek Upravljanje virov "
"lahko odprete tako, da odprete meni :menuselection:'Nastavitve --> "
"upravljanje virov...' menij."

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management.rst:108
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You can do a variety of things here, like deleting backup files, mass-"
"tagging, deleting/deactivating the resource itself, importing resources and "
"open the create bundle dialog."
msgstr ""
"Tukaj lahko naredite različne stvari, kot so brisanje datotek varnostne "
"kopije, množično označevanje, brisanje/deaktiviranje samega vira, uvoz virov "
"in odpiranje pogovornega okna ustvarite svežnje."

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management.rst:113
msgid "Importing resources"
msgstr "Uvažanje virov"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management.rst:115
msgid ""
"To import resources, select the :guilabel:`import` in the resource choosers "
"or the resource manager."
msgstr ""
"Če želite uvoziti vire, izberite :guilabel:`Uvozi` v izbiralnikih virov ali "
"upravitelju virov."

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management.rst:117
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The resource chooser import is fairly straight forward. You can only select "
"certain kinds of files, and all the files you can select are possible to "
"import for that resource."
msgstr ""
"Uvoz izbiralnika virov je precej naravnost naprej. Izberete lahko le "
"določene vrste datotek in vse datoteke, ki jih lahko izberete, so mogoče "
"uvoziti za ta vir."

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management.rst:119
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The import button in the resource manager however sometimes needs to make a "
"choice on whether an imported :ref:`file_png` file is a brush tip or a "
"texture. When importing a format that can be used for multiple types of "
"resources, a window will pop up asking which resource type you intended to "
"import the file for."
msgstr ""
"Gumb za uvoz v upravitelju virov pa se mora včasih odločiti, ali je uvožena "
"datoteka :ref:'file_png' nasvet za krtačo ali tekstura. Pri uvozu oblike, ki "
"jo je mogoče uporabiti za več vrst virov, se prikaže okno z vprašanjem, za "
"katero vrsto vira ste nameravali uvoziti datoteko."

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management.rst:125
msgid "Activating and Deactivating"
msgstr "Aktiviranje in deaktiviranje"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management.rst:127
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Deactivating resources is done by selecting them in their respective "
"resource chooser, and pressing the trashcan icon."
msgstr ""
"Deaktiviranje virov se opravi tako, da jih izberete v izbrani vrstici virov "
"in pritisnete ikono za smeti."

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management.rst:129
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"For activating a resource, go to :menuselection:`Setti&ngs --> Manage "
"Resources...`, then turn on :guilabel:`&Show Deleted Resources`. The "
"deactivated resources should now be visible, select them, and then press :"
"guilabel:`Undelete Resource`."
msgstr ""
"Za aktiviranje vira pojdite na :menuselection:'Setti&ngs --> Upravljanje "
"virov...', nato pa vklopite :guilabel:'&Show Deleted Resources'. "
"Deaktivirani viri morajo biti zdaj vidni, jih izberite in pritisnite :"
"guilabel:'Undelete Resource'."

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management.rst:134
msgid "Returning a resource to the previous version"
msgstr "Vračanje vira v prejšnjo različico"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management.rst:136
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"First go to the resource folder, :menuselection:`Settings --> Manage "
"Resources... --> Open Resource Folder`."
msgstr ""
"Najprej pojdite v mapo z viri, :menuselection:'Nastavitve --> Upravljanje "
"virov... --> Odpri mapo virov'."

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management.rst:137
msgid "Then go into the ``paintoppresets`` folder."
msgstr "Potem se postavite v mapo »paintoppresets«."

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management.rst:138
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Backup (select and cut) all versions of the related resource into a place "
"you can find them. Delete all these files from the ``paintoppresets`` folder."
msgstr ""
"Varnostno kopirajte (izberite in izrežite) vse različice povezanega vira na "
"mesto, ki ga lahko najdete. Izbrišite vse te datoteke iz mape "
"»paintoppresets«."

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management.rst:139
msgid "restart Krita."
msgstr "ponovno zaženite Krito."

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management.rst:140
msgid "add only the desired version of the resource."
msgstr "dodajte samo želeno različico vira."

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management.rst:145
msgid "Deleting Backup files"
msgstr "Brisanje varnostnih kopij"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management.rst:147
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"When you delete a preset from Krita, Krita doesn't actually delete the "
"physical copy of the preset. It just adds it to a black list so that the "
"next time when you start Krita the presets from this list are not loaded. To "
"delete the brushes from this list click on :guilabel:`Delete Backup Files`."
msgstr ""
"Ko izbrišete prednastavitev iz Krite, Krita dejansko ne izbriše fizične "
"kopije prednastavitve. To samo dodaja na črni seznam, tako da naslednjič, ko "
"začnete Krita prednastavitve s tega seznama niso naložene. Če želite "
"izbrisati čopiče s tega seznama, kliknite na :guilabel:'Izbriši varnostne "
"datoteke'."

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management.rst:152
msgid "Deleting backup files has temporarily been disabled for 5.0."
msgstr "Brisanje varnostnih kopij datotek je bilo začasno onemogočeno v 5.0."

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management.rst:157
msgid "Tags"
msgstr "Značke"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management.rst:159
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Tagging allows you to manage the resources on the fly while painting. All "
"Krita resources can be tagged. These tags can be added via the resource "
"manager, but also via the respective dockers such as brush preset docker, "
"pattern docker etc. You can |mouseleft| the :guilabel:`+` icon in the docker "
"and add a tag name. In addition to adding you can rename and delete a tag as "
"well."
msgstr ""
"Označevanje vam omogoča, da upravljate vire na muhi med slikanjem. Vsi viri "
"Krita so označeni. Te oznake lahko dodate preko upravitelja virov, pa tudi "
"preko ustreznih dockerjev, kot so prednastavitev krtače docker, vzorčni "
"docker itd. Lahko |mouseleft| ikono :guilabel:'+' v dockerju in dodajte ime "
"oznak. Poleg dodajanja lahko preimenujete in izbrišete tudi oznako."

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management.rst:164
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Resources can belong to one or more tags.  For example, you may have a Brush "
"Preset of a favorite :dfn:`Ink Pen` variant and have it tagged so it shows "
"in up in your Inking, Painting, Comics and Favorites groups of brushes."
msgstr ""
"Viri lahko pripadajo eni ali več oznakam.  Morda imate na primer "
"prednastavitev čopiča priljubljene različice :d fn:'Črnilo Pero' in jo "
"označili tako, da se prikaže v skupinah čopičev s črnilom, slikanjem, stripi "
"in priljubljenimi."

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management.rst:165
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Every resource can be tagged, so brushes in the :guilabel:`Predefined` tab "
"of the Brush Settings Editor can be also tagged and grouped for convenience."
msgstr ""
"Vsak vir je mogoče označevati, zato lahko čopiče v zavihku :"
"guilabel:'Predefined' urejevalnika nastavitev čopiča tudi označene in "
"združene za udobje."

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management.rst:167
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"In the resource manager, you can tag multiple resources at once. To select "
"multiple resources, use :kbd:`Ctrl` for adding individual resources to the "
"selection or :kbd:`Shift` for adding every resource at once. Then press the "
"plus icon next to the :guilabel:`tags` section to add a tag to every "
"selected resource."
msgstr ""
"V upravitelju virov lahko hkrati oznako več virov. Če želite izbrati več "
